{"id": "Dcdsd6BB5bv", "title": "Video by oddfellowstv", "description": "Dream collab alert!\n\nIn partnership with the talented @figma brand team, we crafted an anthem film that challenged the notion that “design is dead.” The film reimagines the relationship between design and code—not as separate disciplines, but as one interconnected practice.\n\nInspired by the patterns and systems found in nature, it builds toward a future where design leads and code empowers.\n\nThe film premiered at Config 2026, just before Dylan Field took the stage. 🫢\n\nBig shoutout to the wonderful team at Figma for the trust, guidance, and dreamy collaboration.\n\n@damiencorrell @chadcolby @jeffersonc22 and Nic Lee.\n\nPeep the full case study on our website. Link in bio.", "channel": "oddfellowstv", "uploader_id": "586968648", "uploader": "Oddfellows", "timestamp": 1787662807, "like_count": 36152, "comment_count": 496, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1494833339122937a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 69.215, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fdmm2-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQOe8fUZ7DAZG7btFdFVNVLhTSx8wcRUJZE5vc1RUzh6VHlVMoPPpsGXDOpkWvGXLrzAj7FfEoekCJzygVwD-bQCmxs5VVznKg4BoCA.mp4?_nc_cat=110&_nc_oc=AdoOTLNBAJsmd_CS03BC2NvKm5o-P8qlmQ1b0e3MX1OrYGbcXtXjVJ7eBfKl4gVK6nDnyAE7tGYfZmv2YB9liV6Y&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fdmm2-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=PneXUL-lR60Q7kNvwEcdrys&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=nTUy_iZqhqP3p6Ov0_HZDA&_nc_ss=7b689&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQTyP84bTjUFp3a-gFyndBniqRO77NYjYl_kysZYeNhv9A&oe=6AEF9923", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 69.215, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,a